If someone needs a workaround, this works:

```python
from dataclasses import dataclass
from typing import *

T = TypeVar("T")


@dataclass
class Box(Generic[T]):
    inner: T

    @property
    def unboxed(self) -> T:
        return self.inner


@dataclass
class Repro:
    fn: Box[Callable[[int], str]]


Repro(fn=Box(repr)).fn.unboxed(1)
```

